Morrow is included unmodified as a git submodule at web/vendor/morrow, pinned to commit
a2daae153279042b662b16a88f592cdabd5f1d32. The following SynapseNote files are adapted from
Morrow and say so at their top:

- web/vite.config.ts (emoji image and third party licence plugins; also renames the visible
  "Morrow page" label in src/app/editor/EditorMenus.tsx at build time)
- web/src/EditorApp.tsx (editor setup, from src/app/editor/PageEditor.tsx)
- web/src/host/actions.ts, web/src/host/attachments.ts (functions copied with the same output)
- web/sampleRenames.ts (rewrites the welcome guide of src/core/sample.ts at build time for this
  app's name, keys and screens)

The Swift data core in App/Sources/Core is a port of Morrow's src/core (markdown, vault, model, commands,
canvas, templates, tasks, tree, daily, migrations) and of the planning parts of src/storage (session,
saveQueue, vaultRepository), written to give the same results; each file names the Morrow file it follows.
